{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Remember</b> — the sense of \"You acquired\" is that they were as though sold in Egypt. It is possible that \"the tribe of Your inheritance\" is: the tribe that is Your inheritance, as in: \"they are Your people and Your inheritance,\" or \"Your inheritance\" is as in \"the mountain of Your inheritance,\" and then \"tribe\" is in construct state, and the witness is Mount Zion."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 74, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:21.112372508Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}